Dialogue: 1,0:00:02.49,0:00:05.32,SC Opening 2 Eng,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,953)}Seeking out...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.56,0:00:26.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.64,0:00:29.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.58,0:00:30.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The first I made you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.88,0:00:35.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am still seeing my idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.38,0:00:37.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am still finding my line.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.38,0:00:38.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I amabolical.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.10,0:00:46.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it's now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.02,0:00:53.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From the beginning of the story, my\Nlife is part of the cult in the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.92,0:00:57.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll continue to walk through
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.86,0:01:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the end of the last page.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.80,0:01:10.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,End of the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.92,0:01:14.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the last page.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.98,0:01:22.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ola, ola, ola, ola!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.86,0:01:24.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hear!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.94,0:01:32.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's rewind a little bit.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.53,0:01:36.50,Title 3,title,0,0,0,,{\fad(488,478)\pos(151,850)}Episode 32: Set's Alessi, Part 1 {Japanese pronounciation is "Seto" which is Set, but from what I can see Seto-shin is always romanized as "Sethan" (even in the card in this episode)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.30,0:01:37.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While Joseph and Avdol were battling\NMariah, Jotaro and Polnareff were.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.42,0:01:41.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And here's your drink, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.92,0:01:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A super-duper tall glass of whiskey\Nand soda on the rocks. Enjoy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.34,0:01:47.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.12,0:01:55.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my, somebody's dying to quench\Nyour thirst early this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.88,0:01:56.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Scandalous.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.79,0:01:58.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Darling, how you do go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.44,0:02:02.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My husband's gone away on a business\Ntrip and won't return for another week.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.46,0:02:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case, how about\Nenjoying a piece of cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.36,0:02:08.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't trouble yourself, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.10,0:02:09.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm quite all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.20,0:02:11.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.50,0:02:12.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kids are great, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.64,0:02:13.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.18,0:02:15.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's almost 9 a .m.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.90,0:02:20.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The old man and Avdol\Nare taking way too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.08,0:02:24.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They may have had a run-in with the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.34,0:02:26.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think we should see\Nwhere they ran off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.72,0:02:27.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.86,0:02:28.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.46,0:02:30.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to go, Iggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.94,0:02:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, I know you're hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.88,0:02:37.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not the only one. Believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.36,0:02:42.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Iggy, where in the world\Ndo you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.08,0:02:43.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Geez, what a stupid mutt.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.06,0:02:45.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.56,0:02:51.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.40,0:02:53.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make some room, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.96,0:02:55.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to play, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.40,0:02:59.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way we'd ever play with\Na jerk like you. Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.26,0:03:00.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys are the jerks of...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.98,0:03:04.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, that really hurt.
