Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.28,0:03:26.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Atta boy, you didn't shed a single tear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.92,0:03:27.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.04,0:03:29.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure you're okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.08,0:03:33.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, kid, how old are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.60,0:03:37.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Four years old. Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.92,0:03:39.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Atta boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.56,0:03:42.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about your daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.32,0:03:43.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is he now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.48,0:03:45.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, he's at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.16,0:03:48.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see, so your daddy's at work, is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.74,0:03:50.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Atta boy to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.52,0:03:52.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And where's your mommy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.54,0:03:54.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's at home doing laundry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.04,0:03:55.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Atta boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.60,0:03:59.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, you came here all by yourself? Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.40,0:04:02.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.31,0:04:03.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then there's no one around to stop me from
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.60,0:04:05.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bashing your face and\Nfor ruining my pants!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.74,0:04:07.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gonna pay to get the mud cleaned off?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.84,0:04:10.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or maybe you're gonna get a job\Nfor the cash to pay me back?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.28,0:04:12.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because you think I have years\Nto wait for some little punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.68,0:04:14.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to work his way through debt!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.20,0:04:15.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You little shit stain!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.70,0:04:22.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.92,0:04:31.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joseph and Avdol are in the middle\Nof doing battle with Mariah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.90,0:04:36.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I, Alessi, shall take on the great\Nhonor of killing Jotaro and Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.82,0:04:41.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're tenacious, to be sure, but I'll\Ndo whatever it takes to achieve victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.82,0:04:44.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Atta boy, Alessi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.80,0:04:49.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enemies name, Alessi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.74,0:04:51.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stand, set.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.56,0:04:53.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God of storms and chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.82,0:04:55.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Favorite phrase, atta boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.48,0:05:10.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff, keep your guard up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.62,0:05:13.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten who you're talking to?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.50,0:05:20.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.90,0:05:21.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.88,0:05:23.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar and Avdol already left.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.90,0:05:27.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it doesn't really look\Nlike there was a struggle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.74,0:05:31.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Old man, Avdol, you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.68,0:05:38.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jotaro, I'm starting to\Nget a bad feeling about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.34,0:05:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.96,0:05:52.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that looks yummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.00,0:05:54.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let me have a bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.88,0:05:56.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, just leave me some.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.52,0:06:02.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That docks with my sandwich! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.10,0:06:05.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back here this\Ninstant, you mangy fleabag!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.00,0:06:30.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you think I have nowhere to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.76,0:06:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You boys truly haven't\Nrealized it yet, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.38,0:06:36.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You only thought you were hunting me when,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.74,0:06:39.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,really, I was luring you\Nhere the entire time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.74,0:06:43.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you're going\Nto fry this time, Joestar!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.64,0:06:46.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you should run!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.84,0:06:50.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hermit purple!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.32,0:06:57.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Adol might be able to defend himself\Nfor now with his flames, but not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.94,0:06:59.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to die, Joestar!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.26,0:07:01.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Goddess Bast is the perfect trap,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.98,0:07:05.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and it's also far more powerful\Nthan your Hermit Purple!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.48,0:07:15.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
