Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.54,0:07:36.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I dropped my change.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.40,0:07:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, where'd it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.16,0:07:40.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.48,0:07:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd lose my own head if it\Nwasn't attached to my shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.92,0:07:46.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.20,0:07:48.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can tell you're following us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.16,0:07:54.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can already see the evil in\Nyour eyes, so don't lie. Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.44,0:08:00.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am so sorry, my good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.52,0:08:01.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Were you talking to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.68,0:08:04.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure I understand\Nwhat you meant by evil eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.26,0:08:08.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My loving non-evil parents\Ngave me these baby blues.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.44,0:08:11.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.78,0:08:13.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the change I was looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.94,0:08:14.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That so?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.52,0:08:16.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then prove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.10,0:08:19.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be easy to prove that\Nyou're not a stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.90,0:08:21.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless you really are one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.52,0:08:23.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Conan!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.86,0:08:32.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, that was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.40,0:08:36.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I was right, and you are a stand user.
