Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.68,0:08:44.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's running?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.12,0:08:47.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jotaro! It's the enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.60,0:08:48.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm hot on his trail!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.06,0:08:52.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.56,0:08:57.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff, where did you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.34,0:08:58.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over here, Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.02,0:09:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back here, damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.70,0:09:10.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rage!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.78,0:09:13.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.04,0:09:15.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy's quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.44,0:09:17.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can he be so fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.76,0:09:19.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, he's already so far ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.80,0:09:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? That's strange!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.42,0:09:23.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to my voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.38,0:09:40.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck is up with\Nmy shoes they're ginormous.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.94,0:09:43.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey watch where you're going!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.68,0:09:46.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you know running around in the\Nstreet like that can get you hurt
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.90,0:09:50.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or worse you're lucky i wasn't the\Nfront end of some out-of-control car!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.82,0:09:51.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.76,0:09:55.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you go and lecture someone\Nelse with that big mouth of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.10,0:09:58.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now out of my way i'm in the\Nmiddle of chasing someone!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.36,0:10:01.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey what do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.22,0:10:02.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.30,0:10:04.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What it's really high up here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.64,0:10:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's lifting me up with one arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.22,0:10:08.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just how tall is this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.94,0:10:10.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His face and hands are huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.78,0:10:11.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like he's a giant!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.96,0:10:14.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right listen here\Nyou pine-sized pissant!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.90,0:10:16.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna teach you to\Ngo around shooting your
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.66,0:10:19.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ignorant little mouth\Noff to adults that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.20,0:10:27.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think you're a big man just because\Nyou're playing dress-up in adult clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.74,0:10:29.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Annoying, good-for-nothing brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.54,0:10:31.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.54,0:10:33.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.22,0:10:36.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move it, kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.30,0:10:37.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.88,0:10:40.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.02,0:10:42.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.86,0:10:44.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does everyone look like giants?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.10,0:10:50.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.06,0:11:07.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.66,0:11:09.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why am I a kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.32,0:11:18.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this really me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.02,0:11:20.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been turned into a kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.18,0:11:23.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is something like\Nthis happening to me?
