Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.74,0:11:35.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could this really be happening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.30,0:11:39.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no possible way\Nthis kid could really be!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.08,0:11:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It could really be me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.76,0:11:42.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my god, this kid is me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.98,0:11:44.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I turned into a little kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.20,0:11:53.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must be his stance power.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.38,0:11:57.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That creeper must have found a way to put\Na curse on me during our fight earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.26,0:12:01.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a sneaking suspicion it happened\Nwhen his shadow stand lunged at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.54,0:12:03.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did I let him do this to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.76,0:12:07.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit, this is bad, this is\Nreally bad, what am I gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.12,0:12:19.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe! Joe,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.98,0:12:26.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,uh, Joe, uh, Joe, uh, no, Jay,\NJackie, uh, what was his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.36,0:12:28.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't remember his name!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.62,0:12:31.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I know this guy, he can help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.44,0:12:33.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why can't I remember it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.66,0:12:35.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why can't I remember his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.52,0:12:36.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey there, little boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.40,0:12:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You, uh, didn't happen to see a\NFrench guy come through here, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.30,0:12:42.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy's about yay tall.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.16,0:12:45.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he's got the exact\Nsame haircut as you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.08,0:12:47.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're talking about me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.82,0:12:48.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.73,0:12:49.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.72,0:12:51.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.08,0:12:53.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asking a kid was an awful idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.70,0:12:55.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.30,0:12:57.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hold on!
